  i This font weight is written as the keyword normal instead of a number.
  
    1 │ /* should generate diagnostics */
  > 2 │ a { font-weight: normal; }
      │                  ^^^^^^
    3 │ a { font-weight: bold; }
    4 │ a { fOnT-wEiGhT: normal; }
  
  i Writing font weights the same way everywhere makes styles easier to read and compare.
  
  i This rule belongs to the nursery group, which means it is not yet stable and may change in the future. Visit https://biomejs.dev/linter/#nursery for more information.
  
  i Safe fix: Use 400 instead.
  
